<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Great Wave off Kanagawa - low poly</title>
<style>
  html,body{margin:0;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#e8dcc0}
  canvas{display:block}
  #cap{position:fixed;left:14px;bottom:10px;font:12px/1.4 Georgia,serif;color:#22304a;opacity:.75;pointer-events:none}
</style>
